  allLines:
  - side: 0
    characterName: Nemelise
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9e123617e7f2f1144af267697bab3b12, type: 3}
    sentence: "It is a difficult job, especially if you\u2019re trying to do the
      right thing. The justice system is so shit that doing good can leave you broke
      in a profession such as yours."
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 78aafcb2f30c885499b2b92021bfe829, type: 3}
    sentence: "I\u2019m glad you understand but it doesn\u2019t change the fact that
      I\u2019ve defended some messed up people. Especially at the start of my career."
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Nemelise
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: "And I\u2019ve performed for a bunch of awful people just because they
      paid good money. You can\u2019t always pick who you serve, especially if you\u2019re
      trying to survive."
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: 'Yeah, and who did you perform for?

'
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Nemelise
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: Some galaxy leaders. I am legally not allowed to say, actually. It
      was a show for a private party. Worst night of my life.
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: Wow, that sounds insane.
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Nemelise
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: "I\u2019ve seen some weird shit that night...\r\n"
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 3
    characterName: Chaperon
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: We now have a second-date special for you guys to play! Are you ready?
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Nemelise
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: I guess we are!
    eventTrigger: StartPixelGame
    choices: []
